   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Woman And Man** (1 review): The reviewer picks Woman and Man as a standout moment of an enjoyable show [2]\n- **Ohio** (1 review): The reviewer notes Ohio is a Neil Young song, first performed by CSN&Y, so it is a cover [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2010-08-28.ccm4.flac16** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 31 songs; 152 min; rated 5/5 by 3 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The show was sold out, and the Meat Puppets played the opening set [1]\n- Sarah Jones sang vocals on a song the uploader footnoted as (2), without saying which one [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2010-08-28.ccm4.flac16**: taped by su6oxone; source: Schoeps CCM4 (DINa, 11 ft high, DFC at SBD cage) > Sound Devices 702 (24/44.1) [1]",
